 "text": "Hi! How's life treating you? Pick spot that's not in the middle of road, but that's not in the middle of someone else's tent either. That's ideal, away from the exit and any river or bathroom. You can move it if needed, but for now keep it from the back and tie it off well. Avoid it if you can. A fire can spread quickly through the wood and it' the one spot you really don't want to test. That's the three A's. And if you' the last one packing up, put up your tent before you go.",
